Package: ichorViz
Title: Explore and Compare ichorCNA Copy-Number Profiles
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person("Emil", "Bauernhofer", email = "emil.bauernhofer@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads, validates, harmonizes, and visualizes output from ichorCNA.
    Supports genome-wide and regional profiles, comparisons between related
    samples, and cohort-scale bin matrices and heatmaps. The package consumes
    existing ichorCNA output and does not perform copy-number calling.
License: GPL (>= 3) + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/bauernhofere/ichorViz
BugReports: https://github.com/bauernhofere/ichorViz/issues
